  "limitations": [
    "Purposeful public-policy DOCX pilot, not a representative sample of every enterprise domain.",
    "Seven documents concern one enforcement consultation; cross-document dependence limits effective sample size.",
    "The long taxi response compilation is genuine source material with repeated respondent templates and personal names; all raw content stays private.",
    "PDF, visuals, scanned handwriting, native Office charts, spreadsheets, email attachments and other format gaps require separate capability rows.",
    "All metadata tags are benchmark-owned inputs applied identically; they are not inferred source claims."
  ],
